{"type":"message","id":"3793395d","parentId":"b9d2650e","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:27:30.558Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我发现了一些公告，但这些只是从首页提取的。看起来这个网站有多个分类页面（如\"项目公告公示\"、\"结果公告\"、\"中标候选人公示\"等），而且还有分页。让我进一步探索页面结构，看看能否获取更完整的公告列表，并提取日期信息。\n\n让我分析一下页面的CSS结构，并尝试获取日期。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"页面找到了19条公告，但看起来首页只展示了部分内容。我需要进一步分析页面结构，提取日期并获取完整公告列表。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_90b329e5ebaf4bcab4f4919e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/scrape_cntcitc_v2.py << 'EOF'\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport json\n\nurl = \"http://www.cntcitc.com.cn/index.html\"\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    page.set_default_timeout(30000)\n    \n    try:\n        response = page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=30000)\n        page.wait_for_load_state(\"networkidle\", timeout=20000)\n        \n        # 尝试提取更详细的结构 - 查找公告列表区域\n        # 常见结构: 标题和日期可能在同一个li或tr中\n        \n        # 方法1: 查找包含日期的元素\n        # 尝试不同的选择器来找到日期信息\n        print(\"=== 分析页面结构 ===\")\n        \n        # 查看页面的主要区域\n        main_content = page.query_selector(\"#main, .main, .content, #content\")\n        if main_content:\n            print(f\"Found main content area\")\n        \n        # 查找所有包含日期的链接\n        # 通常日期会出现在链接附近，可能是 span, font, div 等\n        all_links_with_context = page.evaluate('''\n            () => {\n                const results = [];\n                const links = document.querySelectorAll('a[href*=\"contentId\"]');\n                links.forEach(link => {\n                    const parent = link.parentElement;\n                    const grandparent = parent ? parent.parentElement : null;\n                    \n                    // 尝试查找日期\n                    let date = '';\n                    \n                    // 常见日期选择器\n                    const dateSelectors = [\n                        '.date', '.time', '.datetime', \n                        'span.date', 'span.time',\n                        'font.date', 'font.time',\n                        'td.date', 'td.time',\n                        'li > span:last-child',\n                        'a + span', 'a ~ span'\n                    ];\n                    \n                    for (const sel of dateSelectors) {\n                        const dateEl = parent ? parent.querySelector(sel) : null;\n                        if (dateEl) {\n                            date = dateEl.textContent.trim();\n                            break;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    \n                    // 如果没找到，尝试从父元素获取所有文本\n                    if (!date && parent) {\n                        const text = parent.textContent;\n                        // 匹配日期格式 2026-xx-xx 或 2026/xx/xx\n                        const dateMatch = text.match(/\\\\d{4}[-/年]\\\\d{1,2}[-/月]\\\\d{1,2}/);\n                        if (dateMatch) {\n                            date = dateMatch[0];\n                        }\n                    }\n                    \n                    results.push({\n                        title: link.textContent.trim(),\n                        href: link.href,\n                        date: date\n                    });\n                });\n                return results;\n            }\n        ''')\n        \n        print(f\"\\n=== 找到 {len(all_links_with_context)} 个带内容ID的链接 ===\")\n        for i, item in enumerate(all_links_with_context[:30], 1):\n            print(f\"{i}. [{item['date']}] {item['title'][:60]}...\")\n            print(f\"   URL: {item['href']}\")\n            \n        # 保存结果\n        result = {\n            \"url\": url,\n            \"total_found\": len(all_links_with_context),\n            \"announcements\": all_links_with_context\n        }\n        \n        with open(\"/tmp/cntcitc_result.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(result, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n            \n        print(f\"\\n结果已保存\")\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error: {e}\")\n        import traceback\n        traceback.print_exc()\n    finally:\n        browser.close()\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/scrape_cntcitc_v2.py","timeout":60000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773483992058}}
