{"type":"message","id":"4378ad0c","parentId":"6855b381","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:28:45.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我找到了62条包含contentId的链接，其中有日期的公告约30条。让我提取所有公告并生成最终报告。我需要过滤掉新闻类的内容（chanType=2是新闻），只保留招标公告相关的内容（chanType=3是公告）。\n\n让我再运行一次脚本，只提取公告（chanType=3）并获取完整数据。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"很好！找到了62条内容。让我过滤出真正的公告（chanType=3）并生成最终报告：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2949676c99b845ab815f2db7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/scrape_final.py << 'EOF'\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport json\nimport re\n\nurl = \"http://www.cntcitc.com.cn/index.html\"\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    page.set_default_timeout(30000)\n    \n    try:\n        page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=30000)\n        page.wait_for_load_state(\"networkidle\", timeout=20000)\n        \n        # 提取所有包含contentId的链接\n        all_items = page.evaluate('''\n            () => {\n                const results = [];\n                const links = document.querySelectorAll('a[href*=\"contentId\"]');\n                links.forEach(link => {\n                    const parent = link.parentElement;\n                    let date = '';\n                    \n                    // 尝试匹配日期格式\n                    if (parent) {\n                        const text = parent.textContent;\n                        const dateMatch = text.match(/\\\\d{4}[-/年]\\\\d{1,2}[-/月]\\\\d{1,2}/);\n                        if (dateMatch) {\n                            date = dateMatch[0].replace(/年/g, '-').replace(/月/g, '').replace(/日/g, '');\n                        }\n                    }\n                    \n                    results.push({\n                        title: link.textContent.trim(),\n                        href: link.href,\n                        date: date\n                    });\n                });\n                return results;\n            }\n        ''')\n        \n        # 过滤：只保留公告类 (chanType=3)，排除新闻 (chanType=2)\n        announcements = []\n        seen = set()\n        \n        for item in all_items:\n            # 只保留chanType=3的公告\n            if 'chanType=3' in item['href']:\n                # 标准化日期\n                date = item['date']\n                title = item['title']\n                href = item['href']\n                \n                # 去重\n                key = (title, href)\n                if key not in seen and len(title) > 5:\n                    seen.add(key)\n                    announcements.append({\n                        'title': title,\n                        'date': date if date else 'N/A',\n                        'href': href\n                    })\n        \n        # 按日期排序（最新的在前）\n        announcements.sort(key=lambda x: x['date'], reverse=True)\n        \n        # 输出Markdown表格\n        print(\"| # | 标题 | 发布日期 | 链接 |\")\n        print(\"|---|------|----------|------|\")\n        \n        for i, ann in enumerate(announcements, 1):\n            # 截断过长的标题\n            title = ann['title'][:70] + '...' if len(ann['title']) > 70 else ann['title']\n            print(f\"| {i} | {title} | {ann['date']} | {ann['href']} |\")\n        \n        print(f\"\\n共找到 {len(announcements)} 条公告\")\n        \n        # 保存到输出目录\n        output_dir = \"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/output/2026-03-14/\"\n        \n        # 保存JSON\n        result = {\n            \"website\": \"中招国际招标有限公司\",\n            \"url\": url,\n            \"total\": len(announcements),\n            \"announcements\": announcements\n        }\n        \n        with open(f\"{output_dir}result.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(result, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n        \n        # 保存Markdown表格\n        md_content = \"# 中招国际招标有限公司 公告列表\\n\\n\"\n        md_content += f\"**抓取日期**: 2026-03-14\\n\\n\"\n        md_content += f\"**来源**: {url}\\n\\n\"\n        md_content += f\"**总数**: {len(announcements)} 条\\n\\n\"\n        md_content += \"| # | 标题 | 发布日期 | 链接 |\\n\"\n        md_content += \"|---|------|----------|------|\\n\"\n        \n        for i, ann in enumerate(announcements, 1):\n            title = ann['title'][:70] + '...' if len(ann['title']) > 70 else ann['title']\n            md_content += f\"| {i} | {title} | {ann['date']} | {ann['href']} |\\n\"\n        \n        with open(f\"{output_dir}announcements.md\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            f.write(md_content)\n        \n        print(f\"\\n结果已保存到 {output_dir}\")\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error: {e}\")\n        import traceback\n        traceback.print_exc()\n    finally:\n        browser.close()\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/scrape_final.py","timeout":60000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773484053891}}
